  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ASFC Fr&#xe4;mja m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och kamp mot straffrihet i Guatemala 2024-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASFC Strengthening human rights and fighting impunity in Guatemala 2024-2026 - ASFC Strengthening human rights and fighting impunity in Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Lawyers Without Borders (LWBC eller Abogados Sin Fronteras, ASFC, p&#xe5; spanska) &#xe4;r en icke&#xad;statlig organisation f&#xf6;r internationellt utvecklingssamarbete med s&#xe4;te i Quebec i Kanada och med syfte att st&#xf6;dja f&#xf6;rsvaret av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor i utsatta situationer genom att st&#xe4;rka tillg&#xe5;ngen till r&#xe4;ttvisa och juridisk representation. ASFC:s arbete i Guatemala &#xe4;r mycket relevant f&#xf6;r Sveriges strategi 2021-&#xad;2025 och v&#xe4;l i linje med strategins f&#xf6;rsta m&#xe5;l: &quot;St&#xe4;rkta f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r demokrati och &#xf6;kad respekt f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och r&#xe4;ttsstatens principer.&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lawyers Without Borders (LWBC or Abogados Sin Fronteras, ASFC, in Spanish) is a non-governmental organization for international development cooperation based in Quebec, Canada, with the aim of supporting the defense of human rights for people in vulnerable situations by strengthening access to justice and legal representation. ASFC&apos;s work in Guatemala is very relevant to Sweden&apos;s strategy 2021-2025 and well in line with the strategy&apos;s first goal: &quot;Improved conditions for democracy and increased respect for human rights and the rule of law.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida supports ASFC&apos;s strategic plan and operations in Guatemala as a whole, enabling ASFC to contribute to the fulfillment of the human rights of people in vulnerable situations and strengthening access to justice and legal representation.</narrative>
  </description>
